        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-890.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-890-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH891-ZORSE-MOE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH892-MOE-MERKLE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH893-MOE-DISP-LAT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH894-895M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
